 AI‐Generated Meal Plans for Simulated Diabetes Profiles: A Guideline‐Based Comparison of Three Language Models#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[39,41],"#Evaluating AI‐Generated Meal Plans for Simulated Diabetes Profiles: A Guideline‐Based Comparison of Three Language Models#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[40,41],"#Evaluating AI‐Generated Meal Plans for Simulated Diabetes Profiles: A Guideline‐Based Comparison of Three Language Models#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[42,44],"#Evaluating AI‐Generated Meal Plans for Simulated Diabetes Profiles: A Guideline‐Based Comparison of Three Language Models#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[43,44],"#Evaluating AI‐Generated Meal Plans for Simulated Diabetes Profiles: A Guideline‐Based Comparison of Three Language Models#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[45,46]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/T74ZZZZ7","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/SG9A9BJS?page=1&annotation=3R3T5CE5","line":37},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/SG9A9BJS?page=1&annotation=LQ87A3EB","line":37},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/SG9A9BJS?page=1&annotation=Y5ZWAQ2V","line":40},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/SG9A9BJS?page=1&annotation=KMQ5NFE8","line":43},{"title":"Sayfa 11","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/SG9A9BJS?page=11&annotation=N2AR2ZX3","line":43},{"title":"Sayfa 11","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/SG9A9BJS?page=11&annotation=USPLFC7J","line":43},{"title":"Sayfa 12","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/SG9A9BJS?page=12&annotation=P279KSVW","line":43}],"metadata":{"Title":"Evaluating AI‐Generated Meal Plans for Simulated Diabetes Profiles: A Guideline‐Based Comparison of Three Language Models","Authors":"Hatice Merve Bayram, Sedat Arslan, Arda Ozturkcan","Year":2025,"DOI":"10.1111/jep.70295","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"study aimed to evaluate and compare the performance of three prominent large language models (LLMs)—ChatGPT‐4.1, Grok‐3 and DeepSeek—in generating medical nutrition therapy aligned dietary plans for adults with type 2 diabetes mellitus (T2DM).category. Each LLM was prompted in Turkish to generate 3‐day meal plans. Outputs were assessed for energy and macro‐/micronutrient accuracy, adherence to national and international T2DM guidelines and alignment with the nutrition care process (NCP).","Findings":"carbohydrates. None of the models demonstrated full concordance with the NCP framework, particularly in the diagnosis and monitoring components. Frequent hallucinations and lack of clinical contextualization were noted. Integration of retrieval‐augmented generation (RAG) was identified as a potential improvement strategy","Conclusions":"While LLMs showed promise in generating baseline dietary guidance in a simulated context, these results reflected concordance with guideline documents only and concordance with guideline documents only and should not be interpreted as evidence of equivalence to dietitian‐led careFirst, implementing RAG systems in tandem with human oversight is essential. AI‐driven dietary planning tools should be connected to authoritative clinical guideline databases—such as those from the ADA, IDF and the Turkish Diabetes Society—and require validation by licensed dietitiansSecond, developing personalized prompting strategies is critical for improving NCP compliance.effectiveness. LLM‐generated meal plans should not be used in clinical settings without validation through real‐world trials and expert oversight, as this study assessed only simulated outputs against guideline documents.  Future studies incorporating patient‐level data, clinical outcomes and multilingual validation will be essential for assessing the true clinical utility of AI‐assisted dietary planning tools.","Limitations":"","User_Notes":"prompt var  dyt değerlendirmesi var, karşılaştırması yok  dyt-klinik doğrulaması gerekir diyor"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"16i0wuy","at":1774939653845}},"smart_blocks:bayramEvaluatingAIGeneratedMeal2025b.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.07730541,0.02594452,0.03123319,0.00415358,-0.03219047,0.0277838,-0.04191472,0.0424406,-0.00934201,-0.04335097,-0.00781,-0.09077031,0.00697451,0.04438505,0.0542694,0.00094519,0.00206802,0.00251255,-0.00504571,-0.00801766,0.0831543,-0.04599755,0.02708175,0.0104572,0.0520208,0.01954244,-0.00661538,-0.00772688,-0.09322802,-0.24079905,0.02238421,0.00704121,0.01995679,-0.03240195,-0.08653608,0.02475608,-0.01399122,0.07821343,-0.02124971,0.03414976,0.03997126,-0.00612141,0.04038019,-0.00292776,0.01457938,-0.03796009,-0.06642136,-0.01668389,-0.05737921,-0.01611773,-0.00621666,-0.03684436,0.03720227,0.04078975,0.04736888,0.0197041,0.02453827,0.00991696,0.01957451,0.01809907,0.02174522,0.0824882,-0.24007288,0.0697431,0.01818831,0.05467185,-0.03276146,0.03020909,0.01811074,-0.00414311,-0.07759673,-0.00667082,0.09234287,0.06443471,0.04133779,0.02320535,0.05226139,-0.02205996,0.00431392,-0.02201809,-0.01150193,0.07550196,-0.01350291,-0.05954957,-0.02273793,-0.03571052,-0.03148061,-0.03576158,0.03425183,-0.02365588,-0.02633219,-0.0458955,-0.06206455,-0.00804883,-0.01663158,-0.02366531,-0.0157769,-0.03260775,-0.06577811,0.09819468,0.02445134,-0.00418481,0.00405761,0.00596926,0.02744709,-0.08023711,-0.07922669,-0.01739642,-0.0219527,0.02662664,-0.02346841,0.02558115,0.03725316,0.00540451,-0.02976622,0.05066307,0.1258329,0.00499985,0.00449393,0.0105499,-0.07047151,0.03038224,0.02699508,-0.03458602,-0.01872249,0.00905885,0.01080756,0.07932089,0.04371133,-0.00545934,0.08802637,-0.0116367,-0.05914235,-0.01751782,-0.00057228,-0.03778467,0.01334722,-0.02879735,-0.01046434,0.03069147,-0.01797689,0.0190857,0.0014683,-0.08526443,-0.04369859,0.2001961,0.00625457,0.05234629,-0.078960